{"ID":"20240506082125-kxwzq5j","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506082125-kxwzq5j","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506082125-kxwzq5j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240626105322-ry92od7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612102556-0ae1v9y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240626105322-ry92od7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:6,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:6\u0026#125;","title":"215紫葳（凌霄花）","type":"doc","updated":"20240821120649"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240710091815-f9exdtn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710091815-f9exdtn","updated":"20240710091816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206112445-6rong5r.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821120619-z66s3xr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821120619-z66s3xr","updated":"20240821120619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 478px;","style":"width: 468px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"凌霄 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/凌霄 8-20240821120619-c93o7et.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 468px;\" parent-style=\"width: 478px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 749px;","style":"width: 739px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"凌霄 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/凌霄 7-20240821120538-3qr3ke0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 739px;\" parent-style=\"width: 749px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626105322-kztnldd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626105322-kztnldd","updated":"20240821120638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 584px;","style":"width: 574px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"凌霄花2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/凌霄花2-20240620081624-rqxdrdz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 574px;\" parent-style=\"width: 584px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 583px;","style":"width: 573px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"凌霄花4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/凌霄花4-20240620081638-djf69bl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 573px;\" parent-style=\"width: 583px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821115351-nefspwj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821115351-nefspwj","updated":"20240821120639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 460px;","style":"width: 450px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"凌霄花1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/凌霄花1-20240620081615-6hnlg6e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 450px;\" parent-style=\"width: 460px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 625px;","style":"width: 615px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"凌霄 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/凌霄 3-20240821115413-olu1kq5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 615px;\" parent-style=\"width: 625px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626105322-du6ywl0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626105322-du6ywl0","updated":"20240821120642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 814px;","style":"width: 804px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"凌霄花5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/凌霄花5-20240620081647-j99b4h0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 804px;\" parent-style=\"width: 814px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 350px;","style":"width: 340px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"凌霄 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/凌霄 4-20240821115639-86fa4us.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 340px;\" parent-style=\"width: 350px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626105322-rmy0v6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626105322-rmy0v6b","updated":"20240821120644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 418px;","style":"width: 408px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"凌霄花2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/凌霄花2-20240626105248-au5qbq8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 408px;\" parent-style=\"width: 418px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 736px;","style":"width: 726px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"凌霄花6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/凌霄花6-20240620081707-dpuz1g1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 726px;\" parent-style=\"width: 736px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626113318-p4vnrte","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626113318-p4vnrte","updated":"20240821120646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 580px;","style":"width: 570px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"凌霄花1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/凌霄花1-20240626104949-wc1y50w.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 570px;\" parent-style=\"width: 580px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 619px;","style":"width: 609px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"凌霄 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/凌霄 5-20240821120208-1x6x9k6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 609px;\" parent-style=\"width: 619px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821115219-se5c6kl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821115219-se5c6kl","updated":"20240821120648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 604px;","style":"width: 594px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"凌霄 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/凌霄 1-20240821115219-uns4upb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 594px;\" parent-style=\"width: 604px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 678px;","style":"width: 668px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"凌霄 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/凌霄 2-20240821115246-t3c1y5l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 668px;\" parent-style=\"width: 678px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821114819-qouz5l9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821114819-qouz5l9","updated":"20240821120649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 956px;","style":"width: 946px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"凌霄"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/凌霄-20240821114819-womx5ny.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 946px;\" parent-style=\"width: 956px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612101957-2ypmzq7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612101957-2ypmzq7"}},{"ID":"20240612102404-fuqqt25","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612102404-fuqqt25","updated":"20240612102409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫葳《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102404-w8zl6ci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102404-w8zl6ci","updated":"20240612102404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸，（《御览》作咸）微寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102404-gp85b5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102404-gp85b5h","updated":"20240612102404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主妇人产乳余疾，崩中，症瘕，血闭，寒热，羸瘦，养胎。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102404-vkjt5vg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102404-vkjt5vg","updated":"20240612102404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰，紫葳一名武威，一名瞿麦，一名陵居腹，一名鬼目，一名茏华，神农雷公酸，岐伯辛，扁鹊苦咸，黄帝甘无毒，如麦根黑，正月八月采，或生真定（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102404-j6j021x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102404-j6j021x","updated":"20240612102404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰，一名陵苕，一名茏华，生西海及山阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102404-fdt6tbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102404-fdt6tbi","updated":"20240612102404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《广雅》云：茈葳，陵苕，蘧麦也。《尔雅》云：苕。陵苕，郭璞云：一名陵时。本草云：又黄华蔈，白华茏。郭璞云：苕、华、色异，名亦不同。《毛诗》云：苕之华。《传》云：苕，陵苕也。《范子计然》云：紫葳出三辅。李当之云：是瞿麦根据李说与《广雅》合，而《唐本》注引《尔雅》注，有一名陵霄四字，谓即陵霄花，陆玑以为鼠尾，疑皆非，故不采之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612101957-9a3rssd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612101957-9a3rssd"}},{"ID":"20240612102255-78i7x4b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612102255-78i7x4b","updated":"20240612102259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫葳《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102255-5gpb9tv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102255-5gpb9tv","updated":"20240612102255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」凌霄、陵苕、陵时、女葳、茇华、武威、瞿陵、鬼目。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102255-n8bmftf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102255-n8bmftf","updated":"20240612102255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（花、根）酸、微寒、无毒。（茎、叶）苦、平、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102255-hshm5q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102255-hshm5q8","updated":"20240612102255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240612102255-1n5j0ay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102255-1n5j0ay","updated":"20240612102255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、妇女血崩。用凌霄花为末，每服二钱，酒送下。后服四物汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102255-vct7ntk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102255-vct7ntk","updated":"20240612102255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、粪后下血。用凌霄花浸酒，随时饮服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102255-t4c2gfx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102255-t4c2gfx","updated":"20240612102255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、消渴。用凌霄花一两，捣碎，加水一碗半，煎成一碗，分二次服下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102255-ruy1f7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102255-ruy1f7n","updated":"20240612102255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、通身风痒。用凌霄花为末，服一钱，酒送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102255-a2ucetl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102255-a2ucetl","updated":"20240612102255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、大风疠疾。用凌霄五钱，地龙（焙）、僵蚕（炒）、全蝎（炒）各七个，共研为末。每服二钱，温酒送下。以出臭汗为效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102255-api7ohm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102255-api7ohm","updated":"20240612102255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、悲羊疮（满脸满头，温烂成疮，延及两耳，痒而出水）。用凌霄花及叶煎汤，每日搽洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102255-jn7aqxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102255-jn7aqxy","updated":"20240612102255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、月经不行。用凌霄花为末，每服二钱，饭前服，温酒送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612101957-x6uhy25","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612101957-x6uhy25"}},{"ID":"20240612102241-98mb2sa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612102241-98mb2sa","updated":"20240612102249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫葳《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102241-ms0wpk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102241-ms0wpk5","updated":"20240612102241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸，微寒，无毒。主治妇人产乳余疾，崩中，症瘕，血闭，寒热，羸瘦，养胎。茎叶∶味苦，无毒。主痿蹶，益气。一名陵苕，一名茇华。生西海川谷及山阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102241-whz88lr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102241-whz88lr","updated":"20240612102241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"李云是瞿麦根，今方用至少。《博物志》云∶郝晦行华草于太行山北，得紫葳花。必当奇?"}]},{"ID":"20240612102241-7qy8dj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102241-7qy8dj9","updated":"20240612102241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"云有苕之华；郭云陵霄藤，亦恐非也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102427-mycs6jr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612102427-mycs6jr"}},{"ID":"20240612102428-cptyt31","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612102428-cptyt31","updated":"20240612102437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫葳《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102428-pv65ani","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102428-pv65ani","updated":"20240612102428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒．茎叶，味苦，无毒．治痿蹶，益气．一名陵苕，一名 华，一名陵时生西海及阳．"}]},{"ID":"20240612102428-w38dn3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102428-w38dn3w","updated":"20240612102428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶紫葳，味酸，微寒．主妇人产乳余疾，崩中，症瘕血闭，寒热羸瘦，养胎．生川谷．"}]},{"ID":"20240612102444-zou0c55","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612102444-zou0c55"}},{"ID":"20240612102445-1lskfkr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612102445-1lskfkr","updated":"20240612102449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫葳《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102445-8aubyu3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102445-8aubyu3","updated":"20240612102445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名凌霄"}]},{"ID":"20240612102445-2r5idvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102445-2r5idvu","updated":"20240612102445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸微寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102445-13qvqk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102445-13qvqk1","updated":"20240612102445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主妇人产乳余疾，崩中症瘕，血闭寒热，羸瘦，养胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102445-tbradp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102445-tbradp3","updated":"20240612102445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凌霄花手足厥阴血分药也，能去血中伏火。《本经》主妇人崩中、症瘕，又治血闭寒热、羸瘦。云养胎者，以有积瘀在内，瘀散则胎自安也，与《金匮》桂枝茯苓丸中用桃仁、丹皮治妊娠症痼害无异；症瘕、血闭、血气刺痛、疠风恶疮多用之，皆取其散恶血之功也。若无瘀血而胎息不安者禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102417-a9zb4wl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612102417-a9zb4wl"}},{"ID":"20240612102418-hvxbgzi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612102418-hvxbgzi","updated":"20240612102422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫葳《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102418-vfrxdlh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102418-vfrxdlh","updated":"20240612102418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味酸，微寒，无毒。主治妇人产乳余疾，崩中，症瘕血闭，寒热羸瘦，养胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102418-95hldpa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102418-95hldpa","updated":"20240612102418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（紫葳处处皆有，多生山中，人家园圃亦或栽之。蔓延木上，高数丈，年久者藤大如杯，春初生枝，一枝数叶，尖长有齿，自夏至秋，花开五瓣，赭黄色，有细点，秋深更赤，今名凌霄花，谓其花之极高也，根花并用。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612102418-n5yex2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102418-n5yex2a","updated":"20240612102418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫葳延引藤蔓，主通经脉，气味酸寒，主清血热，故《本经》主治如此。近时用此，为通经下胎之药。仲景鳖甲煎丸，亦用紫葳以消症瘕，必非安胎之品。《本经》养胎二字，当是堕胎之讹耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102211-7ic5nu9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612102211-7ic5nu9"}},{"ID":"20240612102223-4szsml5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612102223-4szsml5","updated":"20240612102226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫葳《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102223-r4heaa8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102223-r4heaa8","updated":"20240612102223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即凌霄花。平野蔓生。得木而上。自夏至秋。开花一枝十余朵。大如牵牛花。而瓣。赭黄色。有细点。秋深更赤。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102223-58wers8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102223-58wers8","updated":"20240612102223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"花"}]},{"ID":"20240612102223-ykrsj6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102223-ykrsj6p","updated":"20240612102223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（根同）味咸苦。气微寒。手足厥阴经药也。畏卤碱。主热毒风风痫。治女子产乳余疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102223-ny6dxdg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102223-ny6dxdg","updated":"20240612102223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血不定。淋沥及崩中。并症瘕血闭。寒热羸瘦。又主膈血游风。凌霄花补阴甚捷。盖有能独行。治血崩之要药也。（丹溪）花及根。甘酸而寒。茎叶带苦。行血分。能去血中伏及血热生风之证。（濒湖）治热风身痒游风风疹。与苍耳叶同用。久近风痫。凌霄花或根为末。每服三钱。温酒下。服毕。解发。不住手梳。口噙冷水。温则吐去。再噙再梳。至十口乃止。如此四十九日绝根。百无所忌。同当归红花川芎牛膝地黄延胡桃仁苏木五灵脂治壮实妇人血闭。血崩方。凌霄花为末。酒服二钱。后服四物汤。按先饮凌霄酒而后服四或先去血中伏火而后调之耶。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102223-bxkwaq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102223-bxkwaq3","updated":"20240612102223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕紫葳之气寒。其味咸先而胜。苦后而杀。知其入血而散热结无疑。第丹溪云补阴甚捷则知治非弥赤丹溪湖）"}]},{"ID":"20240612102223-26ebeew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102223-26ebeew","updated":"20240612102223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茎叶"}]},{"ID":"20240612102223-6axrh6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102223-6axrh6z","updated":"20240612102223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦平。主治痿。益气。疗热风身痒。游风风疹。（与花根同功）治喉痹热痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102223-1mcqltk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102223-1mcqltk","updated":"20240612102223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修治〕秋后采之。阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102211-opf2mny","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612102211-opf2mny"}},{"ID":"20240612102212-6ae7uhk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612102212-6ae7uhk","updated":"20240612102216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫葳《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102212-k3by3tc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102212-k3by3tc","updated":"20240612102212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸，微寒，无毒。主妇人产乳余疾，崩中，症瘕，血闭，寒热，羸瘦，养胎。茎叶，味苦，无毒。主痿蹶，益气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102212-tfh1ihx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102212-tfh1ihx","updated":"20240612102212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名陵苕，一名 华。生西海川谷及山阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102212-c8gsv60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102212-c8gsv60","updated":"20240612102212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"李云是瞿麦根，今方用至少。《博物志》云∶郝晦行华草于太行山北得紫葳华。必当奇异。今瞿麦华乃可爱，而处处有，不应乃在太行山。且有树其茎叶，恐亦非瞿麦根。《诗》云有苕之华；郭云陵霄藤，亦恐非也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102212-ax0bk5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102212-ax0bk5h","updated":"20240612102212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕此即陵霄也，花及茎叶俱用。案《尔雅·释草》云∶苕，一名陵苕，黄华KT ，白华尖。郭云∶一名陵时，又名陵霄。本草云∶一名陵苕，一瞿麦皆《本经》所载，若用瞿麦根为紫葳，紫葳何得复用茎叶。体性既与瞿麦乖异，生处亦不相关。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102212-wj11kat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102212-wj11kat","updated":"20240612102212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"郭云陵霄，此为真说也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612101957-560shjg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612101957-560shjg"}},{"ID":"20240612102159-akcvquy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612102159-akcvquy","updated":"20240612102206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫葳《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102159-hwvy8lp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102159-hwvy8lp","updated":"20240612102159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即凌霄花。甘酸性寒，入厥阴血分，破血降火，为女科专药。无瘀勿用，孕妇尤忌。"}]},{"ID":"20240612101957-6ys4130","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612101957-6ys4130"}},{"ID":"20240612102015-tsl31ai","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612102015-tsl31ai","updated":"20240612102019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫葳《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102015-1qbg842","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102015-1qbg842","updated":"20240612102015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经中品）"}]},{"ID":"20240612102015-w9qeppe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102015-w9qeppe","updated":"20240612102015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】酸，微寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102015-qhvs1ze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102015-qhvs1ze","updated":"20240612102015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主妇人产乳余疾，崩中，症瘕，血闭，寒热羸瘦，养胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102015-vi8ltbp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102015-vi8ltbp","updated":"20240612102015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶紫葳即凌霄花也。多生山中，人家亦种。初作蔓生，依大木上，渐延至巅。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102015-fy0ivwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102015-fy0ivwh","updated":"20240612102015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"年深者，藤大如杯，一枝数叶，尖长有齿，深青色。自夏至秋，一枝开花数十朵，如萱花，赭黄五瓣，有细点，深秋更赤。八月结荚，长三寸许，子轻薄，如榆荚仁。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102015-0p03420","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102015-0p03420","updated":"20240612102015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶紫葳，一名武葳，一名凌霄。谓从底彻顶，秉木德自下而上之体用，合入少阳胆，厥阴肝。肝者将军之官，胆者中正之官，原具武威之政令故也。故主厥阴所司之胞胎，少紫合寅申，及巳亥之各半，巳亥即厥阴水火之胞胎，寅申即少阳金木之乳字， 勘越人十有九难，则知太极判两仪而作胞胎，两仪生四象而成乳字意矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102015-fydpe5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102015-fydpe5z","updated":"20240612102015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（将军之官具威武，中正之官具政令，二官能胜其用，能尽其职矣。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612101957-lcy9crg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612101957-lcy9crg"}},{"ID":"20240612101958-36660o9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612101958-36660o9","updated":"20240612102003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫葳《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240612101958-om3pr5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612101958-om3pr5j","updated":"20240612101958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今蔓延而生，谓之为草。又有木身，谓之为木。又须物而上。然干不逐冬毙，亦得木之多也，故分入木部为至当。唐白乐天诗∶“有木名凌霄，擢秀非孤标。”由是益知非草也。《本经》又云∶“茎叶味苦。”是与瞿麦别一种甚明。《唐本·注》云∶“且紫葳、瞿麦皆《本经》所载，若用瞿麦根为紫葳，何得复用茎叶？”此说尽矣。然其花赭黄色，本条虽不言其花，又却言茎叶味苦，则紫葳为花，故可知矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240612101959-eqorpau","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612101959-eqorpau"}},{"ID":"20240612102307-s062e9u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612102307-s062e9u","updated":"20240612102313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫葳《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102307-8dzqh1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102307-8dzqh1i","updated":"20240612102307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即凌霄花"}]},{"ID":"20240612102307-l01xa8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102307-l01xa8x","updated":"20240612102307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气微寒，味酸。无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102307-0qb9xw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102307-0qb9xw5","updated":"20240612102307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶主妇人产乳余疾，崩中，症瘕血闭，寒热羸瘦，养胎。茎、叶味苦，无毒，主痿蹶，益气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102307-cxsqbki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102307-cxsqbki","updated":"20240612102307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《日华子》云∶根，治热风身痒，游风风疹。治瘀血带下，花、叶功用同。又云∶凌霄花，治酒 ，热毒风刺，妇人血膈、游风，崩中带下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102307-b3d5c9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102307-b3d5c9s","updated":"20240612102307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《衍义》云∶木也，紫葳花是也。畏卤咸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102308-iuqdhf3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612102308-iuqdhf3"}},{"ID":"20240612102340-r8v7jwn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612102340-r8v7jwn","updated":"20240612102344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫葳《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102340-0ttr4yf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102340-0ttr4yf","updated":"20240612102340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸，微寒，无毒。主妇人产乳，余疾崩中，症瘕血闭，寒热羸瘦，养胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102340-9w5l1li","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102340-9w5l1li","updated":"20240612102340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茎叶"}]},{"ID":"20240612102340-89hmqu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102340-89hmqu6","updated":"20240612102340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，无毒。主痿蹶，益气。一名陵苕，一名 华。生西海川谷及山阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102340-gj7kj3o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612102340-gj7kj3o"}},{"ID":"20240612102349-jt4epo8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612102349-jt4epo8","updated":"20240612102356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫葳《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102349-kzosokh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102349-kzosokh","updated":"20240612102349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】味酸微寒。主妇人产乳余疾，崩中，癥瘕，血闭，寒热，羸瘦，养胎。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102349-69vr4qs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102349-69vr4qs","updated":"20240612102349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸，微寒，入足厥阴肝经。专行瘀血，善消癥块。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102349-4f3f4v8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102349-4f3f4v8","updated":"20240612102349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《金匮》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鳖甲煎丸"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在鳖甲。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用之治病疟日久，结为癥瘕，以其行瘀而化癖也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102349-usqk25e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102349-usqk25e","updated":"20240612102349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫葳酸寒通利，破瘀消癥，其诸主治，通经脉，止淋沥，除崩中，收带下，平酒皻，灭风刺，治癞风，疗阴疮。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"紫葳即凌霄花。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102357-n90kmbr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612102357-n90kmbr"}},{"ID":"20240612102524-988fnv2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612102524-988fnv2","updated":"20240612102528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凌霄花《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102524-tdu5roy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102524-tdu5roy","updated":"20240612102524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药用】紫葳科藤本植物凌霄Cmpsisgrandiflora（Thunb.）k.Schum的花。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102524-i2su7ft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102524-i2su7ft","updated":"20240612102524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】辛，为寒。归肝、心包经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102524-epc0rds","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102524-epc0rds","updated":"20240612102524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】祛瘀通经消症，凉血祛风。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102524-4b7iyes","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102524-4b7iyes","updated":"20240612102524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】1.用于血滞经闭，症瘕结块等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102524-u59m7ff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102524-u59m7ff","updated":"20240612102524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品辛散，能活血破瘀通经，故可用于妇女经闭属于瘀阻者，以及症瘕结块等症。用于瘀滞经闭，常配合当归、红花、赤芍、刘寄奴等药同用；若治症瘕，可与鳖甲、虫、丹皮等同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102524-iveoo4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102524-iveoo4k","updated":"20240612102524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.用于周身风痒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102524-mldjr2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102524-mldjr2z","updated":"20240612102524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凌霄花性寒泄热，功能凉血祛风，临床多用于血热风盛的周身风痒之症，可单用本品煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102524-wjpsv62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102524-wjpsv62","updated":"20240612102524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外，本品配雄黄、白矾、黄连、羊蹄根、天南星等外擦，又可治皮肤湿癣。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102524-agiptdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102524-agiptdn","updated":"20240612102524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】凌霄花、紫葳花（晒干用）"}]},{"ID":"20240612102524-h0y5flg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102524-h0y5flg","updated":"20240612102524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】一钱至三钱，煎服。外用适量。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102524-wptd3vu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102524-wptd3vu","updated":"20240612102524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】紫葳散（《沉氏尊生》）紫葳、肉桂、赤芍、白芷、延胡索、当归、刘寄奴、丹皮、红花。治经水不来，发热腹胀。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102525-0dk0g3l","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612102525-0dk0g3l"}},{"ID":"20240612102554-cm6ywdi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-cm6ywdi","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：凌霄花"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-53ef7xe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-53ef7xe","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-gfksh10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-gfksh10","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Línɡ Xiāo Huā"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-3arxzta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-3arxzta","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-zgssffx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-zgssffx","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 紫葳、五爪龙、红花倒水莲、倒挂金钟、上树龙、上树蜈蚣、白狗肠、吊墙花、堕胎花"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-9cv16la","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-9cv16la","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-y0iy8gr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-y0iy8gr","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" FLOS CAMPSIS"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-meg73ju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-meg73ju","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-g9a8ut9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-g9a8ut9","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为柴葳科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"凌霄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Campsis grandiflora （Thunb.）K. Schum. 或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"美洲凌霄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Campsis radicans （L.）Seem. 的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"花"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"及"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。夏、秋二季花盛开时采收，干燥。根春秋采，洗净，切片晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-nzdoynr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-nzdoynr","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-oli8f8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-oli8f8p","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 凌霄：多皱缩卷曲，黄褐色至棕褐色，完整花朵长4～5cm。萼筒钟状，长2～2.5cm，裂片5，裂至中部，萼筒基部至萼齿尖有5条纵棱。花冠先端5裂，裂片半圆形，下部联合呈漏斗状，表面可见细脉纹，内表面较明显。雄蕊4,着生在花冠上，2长2短，花药个字形，花柱1，柱头扁平。气清香，味微苦、酸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-1uhoytl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-1uhoytl","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"美洲凌霄：完整花朵长6～7cm。萼筒长1.5～2cm，硬革质，先端5齿裂，裂片短三角状，长约为萼筒的1/3，萼筒外无明显的纵棱；花冠内表面具明显的深棕色脉纹。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-mbj4900","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-mbj4900","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-xstsdns","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-xstsdns","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置通风干燥处，防潮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-5mb9yvb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-5mb9yvb","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-fcyj5qz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-fcyj5qz","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）本品粉末黄棕色。花粉粒类圆形，直径24～31μm ，具3 孔沟，表面有极细密的网状雕纹。腺毛淡黄色或黄棕色，头部扁圆形、类圆形或长圆形，侧面观细胞似栅状排列1～2层，柄1～3细胞。花冠表皮细胞类多角形，具螺纹导管。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-vcb5jid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-vcb5jid","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末约0.5g，加石油醚（60～90℃）15ml，超声处理15分钟，滤过，弃去滤液，药渣加甲醇15ml，超声处理15分钟，滤过，滤液蒸干，残渣加甲醇1ml使溶解，作为供试品溶液。另取凌霄花对照药材0.5g，同法制成对照药材溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录Ⅵ B）试验，吸取上述两种溶液各1μl，分别点于同一以羧甲基纤维素钠为黏合剂的硅胶G薄层板上，以氯仿-甲醇（9：1）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，置碘蒸气中熏至斑点显色清晰。供试品色谱中，在与对照药材色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-nvikl7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-nvikl7v","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-j2blvtz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-j2blvtz","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 花：归肝、心包经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-fhg1ty3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-fhg1ty3","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-vmdi2fr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-vmdi2fr","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 花：甘、酸，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-7vl3tia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-7vl3tia","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根：苦，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-nj8eui4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-nj8eui4","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-vasod5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-vasod5w","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇慎用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-78cdhby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-78cdhby","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-ixwzxax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-ixwzxax","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 花：凉血，化瘀，祛风。用于月经不调，经闭癓瘕，产后乳肿，风疹发红，皮肤瘙痒，痤疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-zc643ja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-zc643ja","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根：活血散瘀，解毒消肿。用于风湿痹痛，跌打损伤，骨折，脱臼，急性胃肠炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-o48gxhw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-o48gxhw","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-hnm99gz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-hnm99gz","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 花5～9g，根0.3～1两，外用鲜根适量，捣烂敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-omqm6vv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-omqm6vv","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-6tc6b91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-6tc6b91","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-j557wjr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-j557wjr","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：凌霄花"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-l387kid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-l387kid","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-ru57xuh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-ru57xuh","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Línɡ Xiāo Huā"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-e26qlr3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-e26qlr3","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-i2a3hdv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-i2a3hdv","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 芰华（《吴普本草》），堕胎花（《植物名实图考》），藤罗花（《开宝本事》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-sp3c8c9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-sp3c8c9","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-sizj38t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-sizj38t","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《唐本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-fjg48ml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-fjg48ml","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-or5jwfo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-or5jwfo","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为紫葳科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"紫葳"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"花"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。7～9月间采收，择晴天搞下刚开放的花朵，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-abyexoy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-abyexoy","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-y90alng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-y90alng","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生于山谷、溪边、疏林下，或攀援于树上、石壁上或为栽培。我国南北各地均有分布。主产江苏、浙江等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-s7itiul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-s7itiul","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-shtzsij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-shtzsij","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 紫葳（《本经》），又名：武威、瞿陵、陵居腹、鬼目（《吴普本草》），陵苕（《别录》），凌霄（《唐本草》），藤萝草、追罗（《分类草药性》），倒挂金钟（《岭南采药录》），上树蜈蚣、碎骨风。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-kok0rsv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-kok0rsv","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"落叶木质藤本，具气根。茎黄褐色，具棱状网裂。单数羽状复叶，对生；小叶7～9，顶端小叶较大，卵形至卵状披针形，长4～9厘米，宽2～4厘米，先端渐尖，基部不对称，边缘有锯齿，小叶柄着生处有淡黄褐色束毛。花成疏大顶生聚伞圆锥花序；花大，径4～5厘米；花萼5裂，绿色，裂片披针形；花冠赤黄色，漏斗状钟形，先端5裂，裂片圆形，开展；雄蕊4，2长2短；雌蕊1，子房上位，2室，基部有花盘。蒴果细长，豆荚状，长达10厘米，具子房柄，室背开裂。种子多数，扁平，两端具翅。花期7～9月。果期8～10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-kser28u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-kser28u","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-ieqyfny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-ieqyfny","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥的花多皱缩卷曲或折叠，完整的花，长约6～7厘米。花萼暗棕色，长2.5厘米左右，基部联合成管，上部5裂，裂片三角形，先端长而蜕尖，萼筒表面具凸起的纵脉10条；花冠筒状，棕黄色，上端5裂，裂片半圆形，表面具有棕红色细脉纹，并散有棕色斑点，质薄。内面着生2长2短弯曲的雄蕊，顶端具\"个\"字形的花药。雌蕊及花盘各1。微有香气。味微苦而略酸。以朵大、完整、色棕黄、无花梗者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-b4vo76q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-b4vo76q","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-0q503pr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-0q503pr","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-u3z2j19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-u3z2j19","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"手、足厥阴经，行血分。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-h4latxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-h4latxz","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入脾、肝二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-ekp251a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-ekp251a","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草再新》：\"入肾经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-6th5sbx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-6th5sbx","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-xvstp6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-xvstp6f","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 酸，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-5qxcxz5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-5qxcxz5","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"酸，微寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-wlx02cc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-wlx02cc","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《吴普本草》：\"神农、雷公、歧伯：辛。扁鹊：苦咸。黄帝：甘，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-2o7h3ng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-2o7h3ng","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《履巉岩本草》：\"味辛，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-2c7lrya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-2c7lrya","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草备要》：\"甘酸而寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-6ogytaj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-6ogytaj","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-ommv7dw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-ommv7dw","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 气血虚弱及孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-cmmdboo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-cmmdboo","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《药性论》：\"畏卤咸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-4eku3fh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-4eku3fh","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《品汇精要》：\"妊娠不可服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-4i1xulw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-4i1xulw","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经疏》：\"长于破血消瘀，凡妇人血气虚者，一概勿施，治前断不宜用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-feqa2y8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-feqa2y8","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-ieqfzng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-ieqfzng","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 凉血去瘀。治血滞经闭，症瘕，血热风痒，酒齄鼻。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-aologzu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-aologzu","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主妇人产乳余疾，崩中，症瘕，血闭，寒热羸瘦。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-vpgynv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-vpgynv9","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性论》：\"主热风，风痫，大小便不利，肠中结实，止产后崩血不定，淋沥。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-m3wr20y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-m3wr20y","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《日华子本草》：\"治酒齄，热毒风，刺风，妇人血膈，游风，崩中，带下。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-7bexzmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-7bexzmu","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《履巉岩本草》：\"降诸草毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-5kytby0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-5kytby0","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《医林纂要》：\"缓肝风，泻肝热。治肝风巅顶痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-cxrg6ew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-cxrg6ew","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《天宝本草》：\"行血通经：治跌打损伤，痰火脚气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-qqjriem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-qqjriem","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-rq9ajb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-rq9ajb1","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1～2钱；或为散。外用：研末调涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-30ai11p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-30ai11p","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-5oww4nl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-5oww4nl","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治妇人、室女月候不通，脐腹疞痛，一切血疾：紫葳二两，当归、茂（蓬莪术）各一两。上为细末。空心冷酒调下二镇，如行十里许，更用热酒调一服。（《鸡峰普济方》紫葳散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-qtrzg7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-qtrzg7o","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治女经不行：凌霄花为末。每服二钱，食前温酒下。（《徐氏胎产方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-25tclyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-25tclyr","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治崩中漏下血：凌霄花末，温酒服方寸匕，日三。（《广利方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-q9d66mt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-q9d66mt","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治通身痒：凌霄花为末，酒调，卜钱。（《医学正传》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-w0cq1qb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-w0cq1qb","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治皮肤湿癣：凌霄花、羊蹄根各等量，酌加桔矾，研末搽患处。（《上海常用中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-uoklk0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-uoklk0m","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治肺有风热，鼻生瘙疱：凌霄花半两（取末），硫黄一两（别研），腻粉一钱，胡桃四枚（去壳）。先将前三味和匀，后入胡桃肉，同研如膏子，用生绢蘸药频频揩之。（《杨氏家藏方》紫葳散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-pswre9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-pswre9g","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治酒齄鼻：㈠凌霄花、山栀子。上等分，为细末。每服二钱，食后茶调下，日进二服。（《百一选方》）㈡以凌霄花研末，和密陀僧末，调涂。（《岭南采药录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-j7pmqhh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-j7pmqhh","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治痫疾：凌霄花，为细末。每服三钱，温酒调下，空心服。（《传信适用方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-4dp9dvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-4dp9dvd","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治大便后下血：凌霄花，浸酒饮服。（《浙江民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-hemlb7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-hemlb7f","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治误食草药毒者：每用凌霄花同黑豆一处蒸热，拣去花，只服豆三、五粒。（《履巉岩本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-pqydn96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-pqydn96","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-joezobp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-joezobp","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草衍义补遗》：\"凌霄花，治血中痛之要药也，且补阴捷甚，盖有守而独行，妇人方中多用何哉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-rwu2v92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-rwu2v92","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"凌霄花及根，甘酸而寒，茎叶带苦，行血分，能去血中伏火，故主产乳崩漏诸疾及血热生风之证也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-wf8jb00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-wf8jb00","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经疏》：\"紫葳，入肝行血之峻药，故主妇人产乳余疾，及崩中、症瘕、血闭寒热、羸瘦诸证；至于养胎，决非其性之所宜，用者慎之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-zow54ou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-zow54ou","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草述》：\"紫葳之气寒，其味咸先而胜，苦后而杀，知入血而散热结无疑矣。第丹溪云补阴甚捷，在濒湖又言入血分而去伏火，固非专于通行者也。如缪希雍以为行血峻药，或亦据《本草》所谓治癥瘕，通血闭而云乎?讵知甄权云治热风，《日华子》云治热毒风，盖化热毒风，即血中所郁之热，化而为毒风也。性虽主行，然必其能补阴而后能除热毒风，是即行为补也。如疑其止能行血，试思此味何以复畏卤咸?盖多食咸则伤血，畏伤血者，必非峻于行血者也。丹溪言其有守而能独行，又岂臆说欤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-7n92kqz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-7n92kqz","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草崇原》：\"紫葳，近时用此为通经下胎之药。仲景鳖甲煎丸，亦用紫葳以消癥瘕，必非安胎之品，《本经》养胎二字，当是堕胎之讹耳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-c7fmlqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-c7fmlqx","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本经逢原》：\"凌霄花，癥瘕血闭，血气刺痛，疠风恶疮多用之，皆取其散恶血之功也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-pc3bgag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-pc3bgag","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《本草求真》：\"凡人火伏血中，而见阳结血闭，风痒、崩带、癥瘕，一切由于血瘀血热而成者，所当用此（凌霄花）调治，盖此专主泻热，热去而血自活也。是以肺痈之药，多有用此为君。妊娠用此克安者，以其内有瘀积，瘀去而胎即安之意也。所云孕妇忌服者，恐其瘀血既无，妄用恐生他故也。此为女科必用之药，但当相症施治耳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-y3p4pul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-y3p4pul","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《本草正义》：\"凌霄之花，吴普谓神农、雷公、岐伯皆作辛，扁鹊苦咸，能消清血分之热，故可以活血行滞，而亦可治带下崩中。《本经》专主妇人产乳余疾，正以初产乳子之时，阴血已虚，孤阳偏旺，最宜此酸咸微寒，直入血分，借以固护既耗之元阴，而收摄浮游之阳焰。可见古人之治产后，皆以助阴抑阳为主，正与晚近庸俗之见，产后妄用温补，耗烁阴液者，两得其反。又治崩中，则专以亢阳妄行，不能自摄之崩中而言，非谓可以统治血虚不守之崩陷。癥瘕血闭，盖亦为血热太甚，灼烁成瘀者言之，亦非阴寒凝结之癥瘕闭塞可知。又曰寒热羸瘦，则又血虚内热，形消臛瘠者耳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-tvwjvrq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-tvwjvrq","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-2z692zr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-2z692zr","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-3ms1i0l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-3ms1i0l","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：凌霄花"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-l7vy9d1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-l7vy9d1","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-f2ldphk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-f2ldphk","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Línɡ Xiāo Huā"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-w1bvypx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-w1bvypx","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-2x23hc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-2x23hc6","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 芰华、紫葳华、苃华、陵霄花、堕胎花、藤萝花、吊墙花、杜灵霄花"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-3xon1r9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-3xon1r9","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-lyqjc7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-lyqjc7e","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Chinese Trumpetcreeper Flower, Common Trumpetcreeper Flower"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-3o2q8zb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-3o2q8zb","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-0qz32gh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-0qz32gh","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《唐本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-jywl18n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-jywl18n","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-d1hytgx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-d1hytgx","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为紫葳科植物凌霄或美洲凌霄的花。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-svwgvmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-svwgvmr","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Campsis grandiflora (Thunb.) Loisel ex K.Schum.[Bignonia grandiflora Thunb.]2.Campsis radicans (L.) Seem. [Bignonia radi-cans L.]"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-a0n2xzg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-a0n2xzg","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：7-9月采收，择晴天摘下刚开放的花朵，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-huhirbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-huhirbq","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-q1b41zw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-q1b41zw","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.生长于山谷、小河边、疏林下，攀援于树上、石壁上，赤有庭园栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-pk22lbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-pk22lbk","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于华东、中南及河北、四川、贵州等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-tuwb8j4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-tuwb8j4","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.江苏、上海、湖南等地有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-q5xi5q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-q5xi5q8","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-1ypl52g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-1ypl52g","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.凌霄 薄叶木质藤本，借气根攀附于其服物上。茎黄褐色具棱状网裂。叶对生，厅数羽状复叶；叶轴长4-3cm；小叶柄长5-10mm，小叶7-9格，卵形至卵状披针形，长4-6cm，宽1.5-3cm，先端尾状渐尖，基部阔楔形，两侧不等大，边缘有粗锯齿，两面无毛，小叶柄着生处有淡黄褐色束毛。花序顶生，圆锥状，花大，直径4-5cm；花萼钟状，不等5裂，裂至筒之中部，裂片披针形；花冠漏斗状钟形，裂片5，圆形，橘红色，开展；雄蕊4，2长2短；子房上位，2室，基部有花盘。蒴果长如豆荚，具子房柄；2瓣裂。种子多数，扁平，有透明的翅。花期7-9月，果期8-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-pgumiuh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-pgumiuh","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.美洲凌霄 本种形态上写凌霄相似，唯小叶9-11枚，椭圆形至卵状长圆形，先端尾尖。花萼5等裂，分裂较浅，约裂至三分之一，裂片三角形，向外微卷，无凸起的纵棱；花冠为细长的漏斗形，直径较凌霄小，橙红色至浓红色，内有明显的棕红色纵纹，筒部为花萼的3倍。花期7-10月，果期11月。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-ek8ybs3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-ek8ybs3","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-m1ar8ys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-m1ar8ys","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.气候土壤：喜温暖湿润环境。对土壤要求不严，砂质壤土、粘壤土均能生长。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-fddq9g7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-fddq9g7","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.种植：2.1.扦插繁殖，可在春季或雨季进行，北京地区适宜在7-8月。截取较坚实粗壮的枝条，每段长10-16cm，扦插于砂床，上面用玻璃覆盖，以保持足够的温度和湿度。一般温度在23-28℃，插后20天即可生根，到翌年春即可移人大田，行距60cm、株距30-40cm。南方温暖地区，可在春天将头年的新技剪下，直接插入地边，即可生根成活。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-627v1sw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-627v1sw","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.压条繁殖:在7月间将粗壮的藤蔓拉到地表，分段用土堆埋，露出芽头，保持土湿润，约50天左右即可生根，生根后剪下移栽。南方亦可在春天压条。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-npmgi6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-npmgi6g","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.3分根繁殖:宜在早春进行，即将母株附近由根芽生出的小苗挖出栽种。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-vldnxla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-vldnxla","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.田间管理：初栽的小苗要注意浇水、松土、除草，5月中旬或6月初可退肥1次，以提高花的产量。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-1906636","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-1906636","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-x89pw6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-x89pw6b","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 （1）凌霄花 花多皱缩卷曲，完整者长3-5.5cm；花萼钟状，长约2cm，棕褐色或棕色，质薄，先端不等5深裂，裂片三角状披针形，萼筒表面有10条纵脉，其中5条明显；花冠黄棕色或棕色，完整无缺者展平后可见先端5裂，裂片半圆形，下部联合成漏斗状，表面可见细脉纹，内表面较明显；冠生雄蕊4，二强，花药呈“个”字形，黑棕色；花柱1枚，柱头圆三角形。气微香，味微苦、酸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-ztcf2rf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-ztcf2rf","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）美洲凌霄花 完整花长6-7cm；花萼较短，约为花冠的1/3，黄棕色或淡紫红色，硬革质，先端5等裂，萼筒无明显纵脉棱；花冠黄棕色，长5.8-6.5cm，内表面具深棕色脉纹；柱头扁短三角形。余同凌霄花。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-ox7x8wy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-ox7x8wy","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"均以完整、朵大、色黄棕、无花梗者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-eqte6n0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-eqte6n0","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 花表面观：（1）凌霄①花萼内、外表面具腺毛，腺头扁圆形或类圆形，顶端稍平，由10-40多个细胞组成，直径39-90μm，含黄色分泌物和油滴；腺柄极短，1-2细胞。腺毛周围的表皮细胞平，周壁有放射状角质纹理。气孔不定式。花萼裂片边缘具少数非腺毛，1-7细胞组成，长43-200μm，直径15-19μm，先端圆钝，表面具线状角质纹理。②花冠仅裂片边有少数非腺毛及腺毛的特征同花萼。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-84u46g1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-84u46g1","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）美洲凌霄 ①花萼外表面腺毛的腺头有（6-）50-80细胞，直径39-58μm；腺柄多单细胞，少为2-10细胞；腺毛基部表皮细胞常向外突起。花萼裂片边缘有少数非腺毛，1-6-23细胞。余同凌霄。②花冠外表面于裂片边缘有非腺毛1-5细胞，长55-300μm，直径16-36μm。内表面腺毛众多，腺头7-60余细胞，直径86-146μm；裂片边缘非；裂片边缘非腺毛1-15细胞。余同凌霄。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-3s0k8ca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-3s0k8ca","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-yokfr8d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-yokfr8d","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 凌霄花含芹菜素（apigenin），β-谷甾醇（β-sitos-terol）[1]。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-063nd84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-063nd84","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-o2lz51v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-o2lz51v","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 芹菜素对平滑肌有中度解痉作用，还有抗溃疡作用，β-谷甾醇有降血胆固醇、止咳、抗癌、抗炎等作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-ptm2b43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-ptm2b43","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-dc5hggu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-dc5hggu","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-ync37hm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-ync37hm","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-ogpez7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-ogpez7i","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味酸；性微寒"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-hdou6eb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-hdou6eb","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-kbb44of","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-kbb44of","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 气血虚弱及孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-n2aina7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-n2aina7","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-hqxay96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-hqxay96","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热凉血；化瘀散结；祛风止痒。主血滞经闭；痛经；症瘕；崩中漏下；血热风痒；疮疥陷疹；酒齄鼻。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-q86ppvb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-q86ppvb","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-4h5fh3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-4h5fh3v","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3-6g；或入散剂。外用：适量，研末调涂；或煎汤熏洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-rr5wk12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-rr5wk12","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-3g85l9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-3g85l9v","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治妇人、室女月候不通，脐腹xIU痛，一切血疾:紫葳二两，当归、？(蓬莪术)各一两。上为细末。空心冷酒调下二钱，如行十里许，更用热酒调一服。(《鸡峰普济方》紫葳散)②治女经不行:凌霄花为末。每服二钱，食前温酒下。(《徐氏胎产方》)③治崩中漏下血:凌霄花末，温酒服方寸匕，日三。(《广利方》)④治通身痒:凌霄花为末，酒调服一钱。(《医学正传》)⑤治皮肤湿癣:凌霄花、羊蹄根各等量，酌加枯矾，研末搽患处。(《上海常用中草药》)⑥治肺有风热，鼻生？疱:凌霄花半两(取末)，硫黄一两(别研)，腻粉一钱，胡桃四枚(去壳)。先将前三味和匀，后入胡桃肉，同研如膏子，用生绢蘸药频频揩之。(《杨氏家藏方》紫葳散)⑦治酒齄鼻: 一、凌霄花、山栀子。上等分，为细末。每服二钱，食后茶调下，日进二服。 (《百一选方》)二、以凌霄花研末，和密陀僧末，调涂。(《岭南采药录》)⑧治痫疾:凌霄花，为细末。每服三钱，温酒调下，空心服。(《传信适用万》)⑨治大便后下血:凌霄花，浸酒饮服。(《浙江民间草药》)⑩治误食草药毒者:每用凌霄花同黑豆一处蒸熟，拣去花，只服豆三、五粒。(《履CHAN岩本草》)"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-w6qfog5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-w6qfog5","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-aszmtdb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-aszmtdb","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草衍义补遗》:凌霄花，治血中痛之要药也，且补阴捷甚，盖有守而独行，妇人方中多用何哉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-yzvwl03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-yzvwl03","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》:凌雷花及根，甘酸而寒，茎叶带苦，行血分，能去血中伏火，故主产乳崩漏诸疾及血热生风之证也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-m20lji8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-m20lji8","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草经疏》:紫藏，入肝行血之峻药，故主妇人产乳余疚，及崩中、额底、血闭塞热、赢瘦诸证；至于养胎，决非其性之所宜，用看慎之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-tdzx6mb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-tdzx6mb","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草述》:紫蔬之气寒，其味威先而胜，苦后而杀，知入血而散热结无疑矣。第丹溪云补阴甚捷，在濒湖又言入血分而去伏火，固非专于通行看也。如缨希雍以为行血峻药，或亦据《本草》所谓治额瘸、通血闭而云乎?《日华子》云治热毒风，盖化热毒风，即血中所郁之热，化而为毒风也。性虽主行，然必其能补阴而后能除热毒风，是即行为补也。如疑其止能行血，试思此味何以复畏卤咸? 盖多食咸贝以伤血，畏伤血者，必非峻于行血看也。丹溪言其有守而能独行，又岂臆说钦。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-12kaotk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-12kaotk","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草崇原》:紫藏，近时用此为通经下胎之药。仲景鳖甲煎丸，亦用紫藏以消额痕，必非安胎之品，《本经》养胎二字，当是堕胎之讹耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-h83u7hp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-h83u7hp","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本经逢原》:凌雪花，额痛血闭，血气刺痛，厉风恶疮多用之，皆取其散恶血之功也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-9a5g67p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-9a5g67p","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草求真》:凡人火伏血中，而见阳结血闭，风痒、崩带、缀痛，一切由于血疯血热而成者，所当用此(凌霄花)调治，盖此专主泻热，热去而血自活也。是以肺痈之药，多有用此为君。妊娠用此克安看，以其内有疯积，疯去而胎即安之意也。所云孕妇忌服者，恐其疯血既无，妄用恐生他故也。此为女科必用之药，但当相症施治耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-6q2br6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-6q2br6m","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本草正义》:凌霄之花，吴普谓神农、雷公、峻伯皆作宰，扁鹊苦咸消目肖清血分之热，故可以活血行滞，而亦可治带下崩中。《本经》专主妇人产乳余疾，正以初产乳子之时，阴血已虚，孤阳偏旺，最宜此酸咸微寒，直入血分，借以固护既耗之元阴，而收摄浮游之陨焰。可见古人之治产后，皆以助阴抑阳为主，正与晚近庸俗之见，产后妄用温补，耗烁阴液者，两得其反。又治崩中，则专以亢阳妄行，不能自摄之崩中而言，非谓可以统治血虚不守之崩陷。题瘸血闭，盖亦为血热太甚，灼烁成疯看言之，亦非阴寒凝结之缀痛闭塞可知。"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-dtwbqob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-dtwbqob","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612102554-b4ooyma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102554-b4ooyma","updated":"20240612102554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612102555-t6go93l","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612102555-t6go93l"}},{"ID":"20240612102556-0ae1v9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612102556-0ae1v9y"}}]}